title: "The Data Platform DRY Model: Evaluating and Operationalizing Reuse at Scale"
abstract: >-
  A structured model for evaluating and operationalizing reuse across the four
  layers of a data analytics platform — code, logic, semantics, and
  materialization — to eliminate duplication and semantic drift at scale.
